  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      249.53,
      401.9,
      272.63
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      284.69,
      401.87,
      307.67
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Bribery (Amendment)Act, No. of 2018.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      319.73,
      401.91,
      377.87
    ],
    "text": "2.Section 70 of the Bribery Act (Chapter 26) is herebyamended by the substitution for the words, \u201cupon summarytrial and conviction by a Magistrate\u201d of the words \u201cupontrial and conviction by a High Court or upon summary trialand conviction by a Magistrate\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      389.93,
      401.9,
      413.03
    ],
    "text": "3.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
